      "text": "Several Livecode widgets, one engine. Each item below boots a different stack through the shared shell at `wasm.livecode.wiki/assets/wasm/shared/` — the engine pair, the icu data and the shell live at one URL each, so the browser pays for them once. Boot the first widget and watch the network: 7.2 MB, measured. Boot the next: only its stack zip."
