    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "52a9d6c48e07b3f1",
      "text": "These three carry `BOOT click` so the network story stays legible — boot them one at a time and watch: after the first boot each costs its zip alone. The Hexagon is 85 KB, the Svg 166 KB, the Panel 248 KB. Widgets without `BOOT click` simply load and display where they stand. The widget on [[About Livecode Plugin]] uses the same shared shell, so the cache carries across pages too.\n\n- [https://wasm.livecode.wiki/many-wasm-widgets.html Many Wasm Widgets] — the measurements and the lineup story"
    }
